<title>UK: DNIB sets 275 mln Norwegian crown Dec 2005 bond.</title>
<headline>DNIB sets 275 mln Norwegian crown Dec 2005 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DKB International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DE NATIONALE INVESTERINGSBANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    275 MLN NOK   COUPON     7.20	MATURITY    20.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-17.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.40	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA+	 LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA3	 DENOMS (K) 25	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   **</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  0.30	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p> NOTES   ** FREE OF WITHHOLDING TAX, WITH NORMAL CLAUSES ON</p>
<p>		TAX IMPOSITION</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
